    "phase": "positive Bruhat phase yields exp(i q cosh(xi) exp(i theta)), modulation exp(2i r xi)",
    "absolute_convergence": "Upper-plane absolute mass computed before complex Fubini, angle integral <= min(pi, pi/v), v=q*cosh(xi); RHS bounded by (2*pi/q) exp(-|xi|) for polar wave; the bound depends on q. Direct at delta=0.",
    "oscillation": "A_prime(v)=-2*sin(v)/v for v>0; for K>0,delta=0, full r in R with weight r^2 exp(-(r/K)^2). B0=pi sqrt(pi)K^3/4; first oscillatory orbit=B0*q times sine integral, second=B0 times cosine integral; report records full densities.",
